  "definition": "Alternative Dispute Resolution by Agreement",
  "effectiveDate": "2013-05-17",
  "historyNote": "#7635-B, eff 1-30-02, EXPIRED: 1-30-10 New. #10128, INTERIM, eff 5-16-12, EXPIRED: 11-13-12 New. #10339, eff 5-17-13",
